Data derived from City Sample content — the extracted road network
(`zonegraph*.json`, `roadnetwork*.json`), the OpenDRIVE files (`*.xodr`), the
traffic-light table (`lights-*.json`) and the pedestrian navmesh
(`*.obj`, `*.bin`) — is derived from Epic's content and is therefore NOT
included here and NOT covered by this licence. The tools in `tools/` regenerate
all of it from your own City Sample install in a few minutes.
